        <activityName xml:lang="en">Rack server, at data center</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Rack server, at data center
The rack server contains various electronic components and hardware; UUID: 526210fc-f2f6-31dc-95fc-c7eebe7b735b
The dataset is an average of four rack servers found in Switzerland and Germany. Those which are modeled here, include HP ProLiant DL360p Gen8 and Dell R740.
Location: Typical rack servers.
Technology: Rack servers used in the data centers.
Time period: Unspecified
Production volume: unknown
Sampling: Literature &amp; own estimations
Extrapolations: Average technology
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_526210fc-f2f6-31dc-95fc-c7eebe7b735b.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
